Go Mono Bold, a subset of golang.org/x/image v0.24.0 font/gofont/ttfs/Go-Mono-Bold.ttf.
The fonts were created by the Bigelow & Holmes foundry for the Go project; the subset keeps
the font's own copyright and licence in its name table.

